  "schema:description": "Monitoring of birds species and numbers within the Greenway and surrounding &#34;Trellis&#34; streets within Dulwich Hill and Lewisham areas. With particular attention to small birds. To also involve ane educate the community on the variety of native birds and their importance of their habitat.",
